{"id":"79fccc7a1f","t":"The Invincible of The East","c":"cv","n":26,"l":25,"s":["ml","mg"],"k":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east","mg":"la-ykhr-fy-alshrk"},"u":1795078117436,"desc":"خصمٌ لعشرة آلاف عدو، المحارب السماوي المستنير، قديس طائفة سون موون المقدس، المنيع من الشرق! أثناء توحيد جيانغهو، خرج فن تقسيم الروح العظيم عن السيطرة ونقل روحه خطأً إلى جسد الابن البالغ من العمر اربعة عشر عامًا لغريمه، محارب سيف جبل هوا الغامص… تسك، ماذا يمكنني فعله بهذا الجسد البائس… ما ازال أنا المنيع في الشرق، وكل الفنون القتالية في العالم موجودة في رأسي. سأوحد جيانغهو تارةً أخرى! وأريهم كم بأسي شديدٌ!!","type":"manhwa","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اعادة احياء","اكشن","زراعة","فنون قتاليه","قوة خارقة","موريم"],"src":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east","mg":"la-ykhr-fy-alshrk"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/1/","mg":"la-ykhr-fy-alshrk|"},"2":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/12/"},"13":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/14/"},"15":{"ml":"the-invincible-of-the-east|/manga/the-invincible-of-the-east/15/"},"16":{"ml":"the-invincible